      "summary": "轮询 http://127.0.0.1:8099/healthz 直到返回 200 或超时（默认 15 秒），每 300ms 重试一次，用于等待测试实例就绪。",
      "tags": ["utility", "polling", "health-check"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
